ans to  delete the experiments  sue is against that and she leaves with  disappointment she goes to the school's  basement and takes a nap there and is  surprised to see that app can see her  sue grows really tired and can quickly  fall asleep as she is exhausted from  keeping herself invisible  they eat at the nearby diner and sue is  trying to tell app of her weird  condition when eileen enters the room  and is about to make fun of them again  sue sees that opportunity to demonstrate  her invisibility and attacks eileen  instead which surprises app  meanwhile dr drill sees the footage of  maria and lenia examining invisible sue  at the lab when maria and sue arrive  home maria is about to pick sleepy sue  up when she is kidnapped by unknown men  sue is still groggy when she hears her  mother screaming and instructing her to  find alfred in the red mask  now aware of her surroundings sue  quickly turns herself invisible so the  men cannot find her she calls kristoff  but he is busy then quickly gets out of  her house  she meets toby showing off his bicycle  skills and asks him to help her he  encourages her to be brave despite her  weird abilities just like the super moon  character the following morning sue  accompanied by toby goes back to her  mother's car to retrieve her laptop that  might help her find more information  about alfred and her mother's captors  she receives a mysterious call telling  her to get in the car's trunk as fast as  possible  although hesitant she and toby follow  the instruction then they hear dr  drill's men's voices searching the room  and driving the car somewhere when the  trunk is open from the outside they  discover it is app defeating the guards  with her tech abilities  sue tells them that dr drill may hold  her mother hostage and that she needs to  get into his facility to save her  she takes toby with her making both of  them invisible they do not find maria  but toby retrieves a cell phone left on  the floor which seems to be